# Connections of this machine to the systems it works with: a reference for developers and AI agents.
# Copy to local/dev.env (ignored by git, never committed) and fill in. Nothing reads this file automatically and
# nothing is installed from it: whoever runs a command looks the connection up here.
#
# Docker host: the SSH destination (user@host or an ssh_config alias) of the Linux machine that runs Docker and
# Devbox, for a machine without Docker (a Mac). The checkout has the same path there (OrbStack shares /Users), so
# commands run as:  ssh "$QCM_DOCKER_SSH" "cd <checkout path> && devbox run -- task <task>"
# Leave it empty on Linux and WSL 2: Docker is local.
QCM_DOCKER_SSH=
